==Description==
'''Quack''', internally referred to as '''Ducky Quack''', is an exclusive sticker obtained from the [[Ducky Revenge Event]]. It is obtained from Level 7 of the regular track, which had a cost of {{DuckyEggs|180}} or {{Robux|44}} ({{Robux|37}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale) to unlock, with a total cost of {{DuckyEggs|700}} or {{Robux|366}} ({{Robux|308}} during the Memorial Day 2025 Sale).

==Appearance==
'''Quack''' shows the head of the [[Ducky (Ducky Revenge)|Ducky]] enemy speaking, with three red lines coming out of its beak. Quacks can be heard after using this sticker.

==Trivia==
*The '''Quack''' sticker is likely based on the Speaking Head emoji.

